      {
        "claim": "Task super-plan-ufz.8.4 requires the punch-list output to include verified fixes supplied elsewhere, contradicting the parent and nested specifications\u2019 requirement that those findings leave the punch list after supported verification.",
        "location": "settled-tree.json, super-plan-ufz.8.4 Acceptance; root spec \u00a74; nested finding-continuity spec Acceptance",
