      "key": "[Must-fix] [P1; cluster 13] `skills/super-code/coordinator.js:2256`: bind each persisted invocation identity to captured source before writing review artifacts and preserve existing partial contents on unsettled resume. The cluster's real-builder replay reused `final-review-resume-same.cluster-1.md` and the assembly path with heads `bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb` then `cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc`; persisted Launch records retained neither source binding. Findings can disappear after integration advances. Source evidence: cluster-13.md and its retained probe `/private/tmp/ufz-cluster13-review-612ea0a7-20261017/tests/super-code/.cluster13-resume-probe.mjs`; preserve a finding-bearing partial artifact through advance/resume and test it.",
